 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Table(numRows, numColumns) starts with every cell colored \"\". selectTable(), selectRow(row) and selectCell(row, col) each replace the current selection (the whole table, one row, or one cell). setColor(color) colors every cell of the current selection (the selection stays active; with no selection yet it does nothing). getColor(row, col) returns the cell's current color.",
  "provenance": [
